WEBVTT

01:32.800 --> 01:33.880
-Stay still!
-Let me go!

01:41.080 --> 01:42.840
-Let me go!
-You finally showed up.

01:43.760 --> 01:45.760
You must be the other survivor
of that slaughtered clan.

01:45.840 --> 01:46.680
Today…

01:46.760 --> 01:47.640
WEI QIANTING, HUBEN ARMY

01:47.720 --> 01:48.840
…the circle is complete.

02:00.360 --> 02:02.160
I am the other survivor.

02:11.200 --> 02:12.240
Come on.

02:14.920 --> 02:18.120
Why did that man come for me?

02:20.040 --> 02:22.080
He is a man guilty of every evil.

02:22.160 --> 02:24.840
You were just unlucky to cross his path.

02:25.440 --> 02:26.880
It's all over now.

02:31.000 --> 02:32.520
This one. Into the water?

02:33.120 --> 02:34.120
Into the earth.

02:39.080 --> 02:42.160
I told you, we met by chance.

02:43.640 --> 02:46.080
I just saved you from being killed
as I was passing by.

02:47.560 --> 02:50.160
Finish this cake, then you may go.

02:51.560 --> 02:54.400
Sir, I'm worried about you.

02:55.000 --> 02:57.680
You saved me and killed someone.

02:57.760 --> 02:59.400
I'm afraid you'll get into trouble.

03:00.000 --> 03:01.440
Don't worry.

03:01.520 --> 03:04.800
Even if I do, I can slip away.

03:05.480 --> 03:06.560
They won't be able to kill me.

03:07.240 --> 03:08.680
Can you promise that?

03:09.440 --> 03:10.560
Of course I can.

03:11.920 --> 03:14.600
Then will you write to me
to tell me you're safe?

03:14.680 --> 03:16.920
Wherever you go,

03:17.560 --> 03:19.000
write to me every year,

03:20.040 --> 03:23.600
so I know you're safe.

03:28.680 --> 03:30.840
I'm going to a place called Huainan.

03:32.160 --> 03:33.200
Once I'm settled there,

03:34.560 --> 03:35.640
I'll write to you.

03:36.600 --> 03:37.480
Pinky swear.

03:49.280 --> 03:50.520
Thank you for saving her, sir.

03:50.600 --> 03:52.000
-Thank you for saving her.
-Thank you.

03:52.080 --> 03:53.400
We'll take our leave.

03:53.480 --> 03:55.280
-Wan, let's go home.
-Thank you.

03:55.360 --> 03:56.400
Come on.

04:24.600 --> 04:26.120
I don't understand.

04:26.200 --> 04:29.480
She's your sister,
yet you let her join another family.

04:30.360 --> 04:32.080
You've been a boatman here

04:32.160 --> 04:34.080
for seven years, three li from her family,

04:35.480 --> 04:37.160
just to protect her from afar.

04:37.680 --> 04:38.720
How long can you keep this up?

04:43.920 --> 04:45.000
I don't know.

04:46.800 --> 04:48.120
I only hope

04:49.600 --> 04:51.200
she never remembers her past.

05:36.240 --> 05:38.760
GENERAL LIU ZIWEN

06:27.120 --> 06:29.480
I thought you would never
fall asleep in front of others.

06:35.240 --> 06:37.760
I am a bit tired.

06:38.360 --> 06:41.440
The sounds and the people here

06:43.320 --> 06:44.560
make me feel

06:45.840 --> 06:47.200
like I'm at home.

06:48.800 --> 06:50.520
Back in Nanwei Trough,

06:50.600 --> 06:52.480
it was like this too.

06:53.720 --> 06:55.480
The sounds of Father chopping wood,

06:56.240 --> 06:59.440
of Mother clattering at the stove,

07:00.760 --> 07:02.440
and of my sister and me quarrelling.

07:06.320 --> 07:07.440
Are they well?

07:09.120 --> 07:10.280
They're very well.

07:11.560 --> 07:13.120
All these years,

07:14.000 --> 07:15.600
they've never forgotten

07:17.000 --> 07:17.960
that you saved me.

07:19.400 --> 07:20.960
Whenever your letters came,

07:21.040 --> 07:24.360
I'd tell them whatever
I could safely share.

07:25.520 --> 07:26.960
As for how you

07:27.800 --> 07:30.880
traveled alone to avenge your family,

07:32.000 --> 07:33.600
I didn't dare tell them.

07:37.640 --> 07:38.880
Right,

07:40.680 --> 07:42.040
it would've frightened them.

07:42.640 --> 07:43.640
No,

07:45.800 --> 07:47.200
I was afraid they'd feel for you

07:49.120 --> 07:50.360
yet have no way to help.

07:51.560 --> 07:52.640
Huai'an,

07:54.200 --> 07:55.240
in a family,

07:55.920 --> 07:57.600
people care for one another.

07:58.560 --> 08:00.120
From the moment you saved me,

08:00.960 --> 08:02.640
we became family.

08:43.240 --> 08:45.000
Why aren't you chopping wood?

08:53.800 --> 08:55.720
Am I such an annoyance to you?

08:56.840 --> 09:00.120
Or did I do something wrong?

09:01.120 --> 09:04.680
We've fought side by side
and risked our lives together,

09:05.360 --> 09:06.600
yet when I show up,

09:08.400 --> 09:09.880
you won't even open your eyes.

09:20.440 --> 09:22.000
I know who she is.

09:27.320 --> 09:28.760
When she was one month old,

09:28.840 --> 09:30.840
that man brought her a protective charm.

09:31.400 --> 09:32.240
I was there too.

09:33.360 --> 09:35.000
And I know why
you never told her the truth.

09:36.840 --> 09:38.040
You did the right thing.

09:40.200 --> 09:42.560
Don't worry. I won't say a word.

09:45.640 --> 09:46.960
I mean it.

09:48.240 --> 09:50.080
You're quick to read faces and flatter.

09:50.800 --> 09:52.320
Growing up in the palace

09:53.360 --> 09:55.120
does give one some sense.

09:58.080 --> 10:00.160
Sense or no sense,

10:00.680 --> 10:02.320
if I had a younger sister,

10:03.680 --> 10:06.400
I wouldn't want her raised amid blood
and turmoil either.

10:11.600 --> 10:12.760
You did the right thing.

10:18.160 --> 10:19.160
Thanks.

10:37.600 --> 10:38.640
It's nothing.

11:16.560 --> 11:18.000
Beautiful.

11:18.080 --> 11:19.560
Shameless.

11:22.160 --> 11:23.520
You aren't asleep?

11:26.280 --> 11:28.160
You slipped into my home without a sound

11:30.200 --> 11:32.800
and wrinkled the handkerchief
I embroidered through the night.

11:32.880 --> 11:34.640
I was going to sell it for ten wen.

11:40.160 --> 11:41.640
Tell me if this

11:42.240 --> 11:43.360
is worth ten wen.

11:53.360 --> 11:55.680
-You did it?
-Of course.

11:57.880 --> 11:58.960
Are you sure he's dead?

11:59.040 --> 12:01.400
Of course.
His body was riddled like a hornet's nest.

12:01.480 --> 12:02.320
Satisfied?

12:14.240 --> 12:15.280
What's wrong?

12:18.160 --> 12:20.360
I'm not sure I've read your face right.

12:20.440 --> 12:22.560
Your enemy is dead.
Shouldn't you be happy?

12:24.280 --> 12:25.880
I hired you to kill for me,

12:27.640 --> 12:29.600
yet you never took a single coin.

12:30.880 --> 12:32.440
Still,

12:33.040 --> 12:34.880
I work day and night,

12:35.480 --> 12:37.320
weaving and embroidering nonstop.

12:39.600 --> 12:41.280
Do you know why that is?

12:42.560 --> 12:43.800
Because

12:45.080 --> 12:47.040
you want to buy a house in Chang'an?

12:48.240 --> 12:50.840
Because doing the same thing every day

12:52.120 --> 12:54.200
keeps me from remembering the past.

12:58.440 --> 13:00.200
Time passes a little faster that way.

13:07.280 --> 13:09.680
IN MEMORY OF MADAM ZHU, HONORED
WITH DEVOTION BY HER DAUGHTER ZHAOLU

13:27.800 --> 13:30.600
Mother, did you hear that?

13:32.880 --> 13:34.280
We got our revenge.

14:21.200 --> 14:22.080
There.

14:25.200 --> 14:26.360
Excellent.

14:26.440 --> 14:28.320
Doing my hair like this
is what I'm worst at.

14:28.400 --> 14:29.560
Thank you, Miss Bai Wan.

14:34.800 --> 14:36.400
Zhaolu's work is truly exceptional.

14:37.040 --> 14:38.520
The work, the cut…

14:39.360 --> 14:41.080
They even make me look dashing.

14:42.040 --> 14:44.760
Yes, she has skill.

14:45.280 --> 14:47.200
You even look human in them.

14:52.480 --> 14:54.360
I'm seeing her later.

14:54.440 --> 14:55.720
What gift should I bring?

14:57.440 --> 14:58.760
She's a seamstress.

14:58.840 --> 15:01.240
Give her a fine bolt of silk.

15:01.920 --> 15:03.000
I'm sure she'll like it.

15:03.600 --> 15:06.320
But a surprise shows more thought.

16:16.560 --> 16:17.400
The clothes look good.

16:18.720 --> 16:19.600
Of course.

16:20.200 --> 16:21.240
You made them.

16:23.800 --> 16:25.040
You aren't so bad either.

16:25.840 --> 16:26.840
Of course not.

16:27.720 --> 16:28.880
You picked me.

16:57.880 --> 16:59.160
So mushy.

16:59.760 --> 17:03.240
He said he'd bring her something.
Look at those empty hands.

17:03.320 --> 17:04.800
He already did.

17:13.599 --> 17:14.440
Goodbye.

17:20.280 --> 17:21.480
This is for you.

17:26.920 --> 17:30.640
Is this the gift you prepared
for my departure?

17:31.560 --> 17:33.200
I don't know what you like.

17:35.400 --> 17:36.720
Anyway, the world is wide.

17:37.400 --> 17:39.920
In the days ahead, take care of yourself.

17:40.720 --> 17:42.080
Don't let hatred bind you anymore.

17:44.520 --> 17:45.680
I'll remember that.

17:49.680 --> 17:50.960
All these years in Chang'an,

17:51.560 --> 17:52.560
meeting you

17:55.960 --> 17:57.280
has been my greatest fortune.

17:59.200 --> 18:00.520
Mine as well.

18:25.120 --> 18:26.040
I came to see off my friend.

18:26.120 --> 18:27.680
It's fine that you came along,

18:28.360 --> 18:29.200
but why is he here?

18:33.480 --> 18:34.320
Yes.

18:34.920 --> 18:37.720
If no one keeps an eye on him
and he slips away,

18:37.800 --> 18:40.360
he'll be a corpse when we find him again.

18:42.520 --> 18:44.800
You really can't say a single kind word.

18:46.280 --> 18:47.560
I thought you were going to propose,

18:48.320 --> 18:49.480
so I came to back you up.

18:49.560 --> 18:52.080
Who knew you'd just send her away?

18:53.040 --> 18:54.960
Why do you all think I came to propose?

18:56.160 --> 18:58.160
Do I look like someone who is sentimental?

18:58.760 --> 19:00.240
I'm a swordsman.

19:00.320 --> 19:02.480
A swordsman!
My life hangs by a thread every day.

19:03.120 --> 19:06.200
A man like me can love many women.

19:14.880 --> 19:16.120
Fine, I admit it.

19:16.200 --> 19:17.960
I do like her.

19:18.040 --> 19:19.360
But she came to Chang'an alone

19:19.960 --> 19:21.680
for revenge and nothing else.

19:23.320 --> 19:25.680
How much room could she possibly
have in her heart for me?

19:27.080 --> 19:28.240
Besides,

19:28.760 --> 19:31.680
I don't want her following me
into danger after danger.

19:33.000 --> 19:34.080
It's better

19:35.320 --> 19:36.640
to let go.

19:38.240 --> 19:39.640
The world is wide.

19:40.720 --> 19:41.800
If fate allows, we'll meet again.

19:48.120 --> 19:49.160
Come on.

20:02.400 --> 20:03.800
Besides Xiaoqing,

20:03.880 --> 20:07.040
do you have any other friends in Chang'an?

20:07.800 --> 20:10.760
When I was a student,
I had a few classmates I could talk to.

20:11.560 --> 20:15.720
But most of them
took up official positions,

20:16.600 --> 20:18.840
and we gradually lost touch.

20:19.680 --> 20:21.480
Xiaoqing is your messenger,

20:21.560 --> 20:23.240
but we get along well.

20:23.920 --> 20:25.160
Having one or two people

20:25.760 --> 20:28.480
you truly connect with is already enough.

20:29.360 --> 20:30.880
Aside from painting,

20:31.400 --> 20:32.520
what else

20:34.040 --> 20:35.400
do you do?

20:40.320 --> 20:41.840
I like the bustle of the marketplace.

20:42.840 --> 20:43.960
Watching folks

20:44.520 --> 20:45.480
choose their vegetables,

20:46.080 --> 20:47.160
their meat,

20:47.760 --> 20:50.600
and their clothes
is amusement enough for me.

20:53.520 --> 20:55.160
Sometimes, I run into an old man

20:55.240 --> 20:57.240
playing the flute on the street.

20:58.120 --> 20:59.800
When I do, I sit beside him

21:00.880 --> 21:02.120
and listen from dusk

21:03.280 --> 21:04.760
until night falls.

21:06.320 --> 21:07.680
Before Mr. Yang's death,

21:08.960 --> 21:10.360
the Chang'an I saw

21:12.080 --> 21:13.080
was ordinary

21:14.920 --> 21:16.040
and real.

21:18.160 --> 21:19.880
I came to Chang'an by chance.

21:20.920 --> 21:23.240
After what happened in the reed marsh,

21:23.760 --> 21:25.240
my parents sought help everywhere

21:25.320 --> 21:27.000
and finally sent me here to study.

21:27.600 --> 21:28.680
It was, in truth,

21:29.200 --> 21:30.520
to shield me from danger.

21:30.600 --> 21:32.560
As I grew older,

21:33.280 --> 21:36.280
they finally felt safe
letting me live here alone.

21:39.360 --> 21:40.840
Your family

21:42.320 --> 21:43.720
must miss you very much.

21:44.600 --> 21:45.640
Yes.

21:47.280 --> 21:48.880
We haven't met for a year or two.

21:49.760 --> 21:51.000
I miss them.

21:52.080 --> 21:53.560
I should go home and see them.

21:54.720 --> 21:55.920
Having family

21:56.760 --> 21:58.040
and people you care about

21:59.640 --> 22:01.160
is a fortunate thing.

22:04.400 --> 22:06.320
If you hadn't kept in touch with me,

22:06.960 --> 22:08.760
those trying to kill me

22:11.040 --> 22:12.520
would never have found you.

22:13.120 --> 22:15.840
Seven years ago, in the reed marsh,

22:17.520 --> 22:18.880
your parents

22:20.560 --> 22:22.560
nearly lost their daughter.

22:30.160 --> 22:31.680
I understand

22:32.440 --> 22:33.560
what you're saying.

22:34.880 --> 22:37.240
But I'm a simple person.

22:37.320 --> 22:39.240
If I choose to leave,

22:40.120 --> 22:42.040
it's because I want to leave.

22:42.960 --> 22:46.680
It has nothing to do
with whether Chang'an is safe.

22:47.400 --> 22:48.760
And if I want to stay,

22:49.640 --> 22:53.080
no one can drive me away.

22:58.400 --> 22:59.520
Wan,

23:00.720 --> 23:02.440
you're as stubborn

23:03.840 --> 23:05.160
as when you were a child.

23:08.720 --> 23:09.960
But this time,

23:12.440 --> 23:13.560
I truly must go.

23:17.200 --> 23:18.400
With my teacher gone,

23:19.000 --> 23:20.920
my parents and sister
are surely worried about me.

23:21.000 --> 23:22.560
I have to go home

23:24.040 --> 23:25.200
so they know I'm safe.

23:38.240 --> 23:39.760
From when we met seven years ago

23:40.680 --> 23:42.120
until our reunion now,

23:42.880 --> 23:44.960
your life has been filled
with blood and danger.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.280
This painting of you

23:49.320 --> 23:50.600
represents my wish for you.

23:51.760 --> 23:53.240
I hope you can tend flowers,

23:54.240 --> 23:55.320
keep a cat,

23:56.520 --> 23:57.920
nap on the porch,

23:59.000 --> 24:00.480
and live a peaceful life,

24:02.160 --> 24:03.640
even for just one day.

24:12.160 --> 24:15.240
I don't have the time to live like this

24:16.280 --> 24:17.200
for a full day,

24:18.200 --> 24:21.280
but even half a day would be something.

24:48.880 --> 24:50.120
Mutton!

24:50.200 --> 24:51.160
What would you like?

24:51.240 --> 24:52.560
Fresh mutton!

24:52.640 --> 24:53.880
Sesame seed cakes!

24:53.960 --> 24:54.840
Hot sesame seed cakes!

24:54.920 --> 24:56.440
All fresh out of the oven!

24:57.040 --> 24:58.720
-Sesame seed cakes!
-Sir, how much for the cakes?

24:58.800 --> 25:00.080
Two wen each.

25:00.160 --> 25:01.880
-I'll take two.
-All right.

25:02.600 --> 25:04.560
-Here are your cakes.
-Thank you.

25:04.640 --> 25:06.120
Here you are, miss.

25:06.200 --> 25:08.040
-Here you go.
-Thank you.

25:09.840 --> 25:11.120
-All right.
-Here.

25:11.200 --> 25:13.000
All right. Come again.

25:14.360 --> 25:15.480
Come on.

25:18.120 --> 25:19.240
The dishes are ready.

25:19.320 --> 25:20.480
Coming!

25:20.560 --> 25:23.720
This courtyard hasn't been this lively
in a long time. Thank you.

25:24.680 --> 25:25.880
Not true.

25:25.960 --> 25:27.560
When he was injured here last time,

25:27.640 --> 25:30.200
the place was crawling
with Imperial Guards. It was…

25:35.560 --> 25:36.560
Now,

25:36.640 --> 25:38.040
Bai Wan is leaving tomorrow.

25:38.120 --> 25:41.440
Let's have a proper gathering tonight
before she leaves.

25:41.520 --> 25:42.560
Cheers.

25:44.600 --> 25:46.400
Things had just started
getting better for me…

25:46.480 --> 25:48.720
Drink your wine. Why so much nonsense?

25:59.320 --> 26:00.960
Complete your missions,

26:01.040 --> 26:02.440
and your good days will come.

26:03.120 --> 26:03.960
Eat.

26:06.120 --> 26:08.360
I'm relieved to hear you say that.

26:08.960 --> 26:11.840
In your letters,
you always wrote that you were alone.

26:12.440 --> 26:14.120
Now you have friends around you.

26:19.600 --> 26:20.840
I'll see you off tomorrow.

26:22.200 --> 26:24.040
So will I. I…

26:28.920 --> 26:29.800
I'm at your command.

26:34.280 --> 26:36.320
I'm glad you'll see me off.

26:37.240 --> 26:39.880
But I still feel reluctant to leave
and somewhat regretful.

26:40.480 --> 26:42.120
Nanwei Trough isn't far.

26:42.200 --> 26:43.760
It's not like you can't come back.

26:45.000 --> 26:46.640
My regret

26:48.560 --> 26:50.160
is that I didn't find my family
in Chang'an.

26:51.520 --> 26:52.800
But I've come to understand now

26:53.600 --> 26:55.200
that in a city this vast,

26:56.000 --> 26:57.480
I may never find him

26:58.360 --> 26:59.520
in this lifetime.

27:05.760 --> 27:07.360
I've been carrying a secret

27:07.960 --> 27:11.400
that only my parents and sister know.

27:12.040 --> 27:14.000
I was not born to my parents.

27:15.200 --> 27:16.560
They took me in.

27:17.600 --> 27:19.080
When I was very young,

27:19.680 --> 27:20.960
in a bitter winter,

27:21.880 --> 27:24.160
a man brought me to the reed marsh.

27:25.440 --> 27:28.440
I can no longer remember his face,
his age,

27:29.080 --> 27:31.200
or whether he was my father,

27:31.880 --> 27:33.000
uncle,

27:34.720 --> 27:35.800
or brother.

27:37.520 --> 27:39.040
I only remember

27:39.120 --> 27:41.360
that he told me
he was going to get a bowl of hot soup,

27:42.400 --> 27:43.680
so we

27:44.280 --> 27:46.040
wouldn't starve to death.

27:48.760 --> 27:50.120
It was so cold

27:51.840 --> 27:52.920
and so late.

27:54.760 --> 27:56.080
I waited a long time.

27:57.200 --> 28:00.280
Brother, I'm so hungry.

28:00.360 --> 28:01.880
Come on.

28:01.960 --> 28:03.280
Hold on a little longer.

28:03.960 --> 28:06.720
We're almost there.

28:07.640 --> 28:11.480
Then I will find you something to eat,

28:11.560 --> 28:12.560
all right?

28:21.520 --> 28:23.520
Sister. Hey.

28:23.600 --> 28:24.520
Listen.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.920
Stay here and wait for me.

28:27.000 --> 28:30.000
I'll go look for some hot soup
and something to eat.

28:30.080 --> 28:31.520
Once you're full, you won't feel cold,

28:31.600 --> 28:32.440
YOUNG BAI WAN

28:32.520 --> 28:33.800
and we can keep going.

28:34.480 --> 28:37.280
If someone comes, hide in the reeds.

28:37.360 --> 28:38.640
Don't make a sound,

28:38.720 --> 28:40.360
and don't run away.

28:40.440 --> 28:41.960
I'll be back soon.

28:42.760 --> 28:43.800
Do you understand?

28:45.400 --> 28:47.880
Wrap yourself well. Now get inside.

29:03.360 --> 29:06.960
I saw a light in the distance.

29:08.800 --> 29:10.520
It was so far away,

29:11.280 --> 29:13.360
yet somehow I felt

29:14.560 --> 29:16.120
it could warm me.

29:17.920 --> 29:19.320
So I walked toward the house

29:20.600 --> 29:21.800
where that light was shining.

29:28.160 --> 29:29.840
That is my earliest memory.

29:30.440 --> 29:31.800
From then on,

29:31.880 --> 29:33.920
I became the younger daughter
of that family.

29:34.760 --> 29:36.320
They told me the truth about my origins,

29:37.240 --> 29:38.840
yet still treated me as their own.

29:39.560 --> 29:41.080
My sister

29:41.680 --> 29:43.360
treated me with great kindness.

29:44.120 --> 29:45.400
But I know

29:46.880 --> 29:47.960
and remember

29:51.280 --> 29:53.160
that I was the one who left him behind.

29:57.560 --> 29:59.160
I chose to leave.

30:01.360 --> 30:02.960
And the price was

30:04.160 --> 30:06.160
losing my only family member,

30:09.640 --> 30:11.200
forgetting my origins,

30:12.760 --> 30:13.920
my surname,

30:14.880 --> 30:16.240
and my given name,

30:16.960 --> 30:18.320
and never knowing

30:18.840 --> 30:21.080
whether the family who lost their daughter

30:22.120 --> 30:23.320
would go on

30:25.400 --> 30:26.760
to live a good life.

30:27.800 --> 30:29.400
That is my regret.

30:31.000 --> 30:34.600
My life began with a wrong parting.

30:37.720 --> 30:38.840
Life

30:39.760 --> 30:41.240
is not built only on mistakes.

30:42.000 --> 30:43.440
Sometimes just staying alive

30:44.040 --> 30:45.400
is a kind of fortune.

30:59.480 --> 31:01.840
I'm fine. Years have passed.

31:15.880 --> 31:17.720
When I was unconscious,

31:17.800 --> 31:19.040
I vaguely heard

31:19.560 --> 31:21.520
that you've carried this charm

31:21.600 --> 31:23.160
for as long as you can remember.

31:23.840 --> 31:25.000
Perhaps

31:25.560 --> 31:27.760
it is your only link
to your original family.

31:28.560 --> 31:29.600
You are about to travel far.

31:30.280 --> 31:31.120
Take it back.

31:32.040 --> 31:33.440
Keep it with you,

31:34.160 --> 31:36.040
as if your family is still by your side.

31:50.880 --> 31:53.600
Why do you all look so downcast?

31:53.680 --> 31:54.600
Come on.

31:54.680 --> 31:56.120
Raise your cups.

31:56.200 --> 31:57.760
Bai Wan leaves tomorrow.

31:57.840 --> 31:59.960
May she go safely and fare well,

32:00.040 --> 32:01.760
and may everything go her way.

32:26.120 --> 32:28.240
Sister! Sister!

32:28.840 --> 32:30.000
Look what I brought…

32:34.760 --> 32:35.920
Sister?

32:36.960 --> 32:37.960
Sister!

32:38.040 --> 32:39.320
Sister!

32:49.160 --> 32:50.480
Sister!

32:51.080 --> 32:52.880
You must be starving. Eat this first.

32:52.960 --> 32:55.040
I'll heat a bowl of noodle soup for you.

32:57.400 --> 32:58.400
Here.

32:58.920 --> 33:01.200
-Eat.
-Let's what your hands first.

33:01.280 --> 33:02.280
Stay with us.

33:02.360 --> 33:04.280
-We'll look for your family.
-Your hands are ice cold.

33:04.360 --> 33:05.440
-If we can't find them,
-Here.

33:05.520 --> 33:06.840
-then you'll be our child.
-Wash your hands.

33:06.920 --> 33:07.800
-Try one.
-Here.

33:09.040 --> 33:10.240
Slow down.

33:10.760 --> 33:13.560
-Have another bite.
-Your face is burning red.

33:14.760 --> 33:15.640
Slow down…

33:15.720 --> 33:16.960
Don't choke.

33:32.120 --> 33:33.160
Huai'an,

33:33.760 --> 33:35.360
I'm an outsider,
and even I can't stand it.

33:35.440 --> 33:37.560
Are you really not going
to tell Bai Wan you're her brother?

33:38.080 --> 33:40.960
Turns out she's been carrying
this regret all this time.

33:41.560 --> 33:42.840
Why don't you just tell her

33:42.920 --> 33:46.720
you've been guarding her
in secret all these years?

33:56.160 --> 33:57.160
Let's go.

34:42.960 --> 34:44.639
My sister is returning.

34:44.719 --> 34:46.400
Eliminate the remnant.

35:05.240 --> 35:06.840
This one. Into the water?

35:07.440 --> 35:08.480
Into the earth.

35:10.200 --> 35:13.160
How is your mood today?

35:14.040 --> 35:18.240
Do I get cooked food or raw?

35:32.440 --> 35:33.320
Back then,

35:33.400 --> 35:36.640
you wouldn't even spare a little girl.

35:38.280 --> 35:42.440
These years underground
are the punishment her brother gave you.

35:44.640 --> 35:45.520
It ends today.

35:50.520 --> 35:52.320
It's been seven years.

35:54.040 --> 35:56.440
I can finally die.

36:19.720 --> 36:21.920
Your family gave me so much care
all those years.

36:22.800 --> 36:24.560
Now at last I've repaid the debt.

37:26.400 --> 37:28.000
Aside from painting,

37:28.560 --> 37:31.400
what else do you do?

37:38.080 --> 37:39.880
I like the hustle and bustle
of the marketplace.

37:40.520 --> 37:42.280
Watching people buy vegetables,

37:42.360 --> 37:43.240
buy meat,

37:43.960 --> 37:45.040
and choose clothes

37:45.560 --> 37:48.640
is interesting enough to me.

38:10.640 --> 38:13.720
Sometimes, I run into an old man
playing the flute on the street.

38:15.000 --> 38:16.200
When I do,

38:16.720 --> 38:17.840
I sit beside him

38:18.560 --> 38:21.960
and listen from dusk until night falls.

38:37.560 --> 38:38.400
Bai Wan,

38:38.480 --> 38:40.920
write to me once you get home.

38:44.520 --> 38:46.400
Xie Huai'an is unbelievable.

38:46.920 --> 38:49.920
I can put up with his odd temper,
but how could he not come to see her off?

38:50.440 --> 38:52.320
Huai'an doesn't like
saying goodbye in person.

38:52.400 --> 38:54.720
But don't worry.
He'll always keep you in his thoughts.

38:56.160 --> 38:57.520
You don't need to comfort me.

38:57.600 --> 38:59.760
I know what he's like.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.600
He struggles with parting too.

39:06.320 --> 39:08.480
All right then, I'm going.

39:10.880 --> 39:11.720
Take care of yourself.

40:12.960 --> 40:17.520
TASK COMPLETE. ALL IS WELL.
